(Japanese: '''結晶塔の帝王エンテイ''' ''Emperor of the Crystal Tower'') is a graphic novel published by [[Shogakukan]] in Japan. It is a manga-style book (often branded as "Animation Comics" or "Ani-Manga") which retells the plotlines of ''[[M03|Spell of the Unown: Entei]]'' and ''[[PK07|Pikachu & Pichu]]'' using screenshots from both films. The book credits [[Hideki Sonoda]] and [[Takeshi Shudō]] as the authors.

